<title>UK: Boosey &amp; Hawkes annual profits rise 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Boosey &amp; Hawkes annual profits rise 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			    (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		27.2		   vs 20.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.43		   vs 5.47</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 9.43		   vs 7.00</p>
<p> Pretax		     7.70		   vs 6.17</p>
<p> Turnover		   94.43		  vs 87.10</p>
<p>NOTE - Boosey &amp; Hawkes Plc is an instrument-maker and music publisher.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
